<title>CHINA: China's CNPC, Agip in oil exploration venture.</title>
<headline>China's CNPC, Agip in oil exploration venture.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's state-run China National Petroleum Corp and Italy's Agip SpA have signed an agreement to form a joint oil venture, Agip's corporate parent ENI said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It did not give the expected investment in the venture but it said the two sides would operate in areas of common interest worldwide in exploration, production, refining, distribution and sales.</p>
</text>
